# Task 152-008 Plan — MCP Smoke Part 2 (Observational + Advanced)

## Objective
CLI-MCP parity matrix for 10 observational/advanced tools (ADR-022-v2 compliance):
doctor, analyze_project, sync, config, history, explain, help, run (dry-run), memory_query, checkpoint

## Approach (READ-ONLY — no code changes)
1. Map MCP tool schemas: src/mcp/server.ts or src/mcp/tools/*.ts
2. Map CLI commands: src/cli/commands/*.ts + entry registration
3. Build parity matrix rows per tool:
   - MCP tool name + exposed? + schema fields
   - CLI command name + flags + subcommands
   - Parity verdict: [FULL | PARTIAL | DRIFT | MCP-ONLY | CLI-ONLY]
   - Evidence: file:line citations
   - Notes: behavior delta, argv quirks
4. Stdio smoke: skip live JSON-RPC exec (Docker worker has no MCP transport). Base verdict on static registration proof.
5. Write report per required template (Özet / Bulgular / Sprint 153+ actions / Kanıt)

## Output
- docs/audits/sprint-152/T-152-008-mcp-observational.md

